        <h1>Your Gaming Inventory</h1>
        <p>
          Here you can add, view (maybe even delete or update) our Gaming
          inventory. You can view pages from publishers to developers and
          finally to games. To add any of those, just click on
          <a href="add-new">Add New</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
